       and exits non-zero. It is intended as a replacement shell field for
       accounts that have been disabled.

       To disable all logins, investigate nnoollooggiinn(5).

       If SSSSHH__OORRIIGGIINNAALL__CCOOMMMMAANNDD is populated it will be logged.

